#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Access"
msgstr "Ufikiaji wa Nodi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the ssh client on each poller that reads nodes."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya programu-teja ya ssh kwenye kila poller inayosoma nodi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Client"
msgstr "Programu-teja ya SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path, on each poller that reads nodes, to the private key whose public half each node lists in authorized_keys with a forced command running pfs-read.sh. Readable only by the poller user. The plugin never creates, copies, or prints it."
msgstr "Njia kamili, kwenye kila poller inayosoma nodi, kuelekea ufunguo wa faragha ambao nusu yake ya umma kila nodi huiorodhesha katika authorized_keys na amri ya lazima inayoendesha pfs-read.sh. Unasomeka na mtumiaji wa poller pekee. Programu-jalizi haiuundi, haiunakili, wala kuuchapisha kamwe."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Key File"
msgstr "Faili ya Ufunguo wa SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the known_hosts file holding each node host key under the node endpoint name. A node whose key is missing or changed is not read."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya faili ya known_hosts inayoshikilia kila ufunguo wa seva pangishi wa nodi chini ya jina la ncha ya nodi. Nodi ambayo ufunguo wake unakosekana au umebadilika haisomwi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Known Hosts File"
msgstr "Faili ya Known Hosts"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa Mwisho wa Kuunganisha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds to wait for a node to accept the connection."
msgstr "Sekunde za kusubiri nodi ikubali muunganisho."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Read Timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa Mwisho wa Kusoma"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node read may take in total before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Sekunde ambazo usomaji mmoja wa nodi unaweza kuchukua kwa jumla kabla haujasimamishwa na kurekodiwa kuwa umeshindwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one node may return. A larger answer is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB ambazo nodi moja inaweza kurudisha. Jibu kubwa zaidi hutupwa na kurekodiwa kuwa limeshindwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response"
msgstr "Kiwango cha Juu cha Jibu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Kisomaji"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Bajeti ya Muda wa Kisomaji"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend before it stops starting node reads. Keep it below the poller interval; unread nodes are read on the next run."
msgstr "Sekunde ambazo uendeshaji mmoja wa kisomaji unaweza kutumia kabla haujaacha kuanzisha usomaji wa nodi. Iweke chini ya muda wa mzunguko wa poller; nodi ambazo hazijasomwa husomwa katika uendeshaji unaofuata."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Concurrent Reads"
msgstr "Usomaji wa Pamoja"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node reads one reader runs at the same time."
msgstr "Usomaji wa nodi ambao kisomaji kimoja huendesha kwa wakati mmoja."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Sakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Weka Majedwali ya Programu-jalizi Wakati wa Kusakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its filesystems, nodes, inventory, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the registry first from the Parallel Filesystem Admin page. Storage nodes are never contacted either way."
msgstr "Ikichaguliwa, kuondoa programu-jalizi huhifadhi mifumo yake ya faili, nodi, orodha, na kache. Ondoa alama ili uondoaji uyafute; hamisha sajili kwanza kutoka ukurasa wa Msimamizi wa Parallel Filesystem. Nodi za uhifadhi haziwasiliwi kamwe kwa vyovyote vile."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delete the Devices This Plugin Created on Uninstall"
msgstr "Futa Vifaa Vilivyoundwa na Programu-jalizi Hii Wakati wa Kuondoa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin deletes the devices it created for filesystems, with their graphs and data sources, as deleting them in Cacti would. Existing devices that were mapped to a filesystem are never deleted. RRD files are removed only if Cacti's own RRD cleanup setting removes them. Cleared, the devices stay."
msgstr "Ikichaguliwa, kuondoa programu-jalizi hufuta vifaa ilivyounda kwa mifumo ya faili, pamoja na grafu na vyanzo vyake vya data, kama ambavyo kuvifuta katika Cacti kungefanya. Vifaa vilivyokuwepo ambavyo vilihusianishwa na mfumo wa faili havifutwi kamwe. Faili za RRD huondolewa tu ikiwa mpangilio wa usafishaji wa RRD wa Cacti yenyewe unaziondoa. Alama ikiondolewa, vifaa hubaki."

