#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "That record belongs to a Cacti device you do not have permission for. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Rekodi hiyo ni ya kifaa cha Cacti ambacho huna ruhusa nacho. Hakuna kilichobadilishwa."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another filesystem of this backend already uses this name."
msgstr "Jina: mfumo mwingine wa faili wa sehemu hii ya nyuma tayari unatumia jina hili."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem could not be saved."
msgstr "Mfumo wa faili haukuweza kuhifadhiwa."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem was saved."
msgstr "Mfumo wa faili umehifadhiwa."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem, its nodes, and its inventory were deleted. Its Cacti device, data sources, and graphs were kept. No node was contacted."
msgstr "Mfumo wa faili, nodi zake, na orodha yake zilifutwa. Kifaa chake cha Cacti, vyanzo vya data, na grafu zilihifadhiwa. Hakuna nodi iliyowasiliwa."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another node already uses this name."
msgstr "Jina: nodi nyingine tayari inatumia jina hili."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node could not be saved."
msgstr "Nodi haikuweza kuhifadhiwa."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was saved."
msgstr "Nodi imehifadhiwa."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was deleted. Targets it reported keep their history."
msgstr "Nodi ilifutwa. Malengo iliyoripoti yanabaki na historia yake."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Enter a network as an address and prefix length, such as 10.20.0.0/16."
msgstr "Ingiza mtandao kama anwani na urefu wa kiambishi awali, kama vile 10.20.0.0/16."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "No device was added: the filesystem already has one, or the templates are not installed."
msgstr "Hakuna kifaa kilichoongezwa: mfumo wa faili tayari una kimoja, au violezo havijasakinishwa."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device could not be mapped. It may be mapped to another filesystem."
msgstr "Kifaa hakikuweza kuhusianishwa. Huenda kimehusianishwa na mfumo mwingine wa faili."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device was mapped and the data queries and overview graphs were added."
msgstr "Kifaa kilihusianishwa na hoja za data na grafu za muhtasari ziliongezwa."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Cacti did not create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti haikuunda kifaa. Tazama kumbukumbu ya Cacti."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "Kifaa, hoja zake za data, na grafu zake za muhtasari viliundwa."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Kifaa hakijahusianishwa tena. Kifaa hicho na grafu zake vilihifadhiwa; hoja zake za data haziorodheshi malengo yoyote hadi kihusianishwe tena."

